    "turn_idx": 14,
    "turn_text": "Now, the president is such, as you mentioned, he's so great with people to watch him with staff, to watch him with kids, to watch him with us. I mean, the reality is, you know, they're a freshman member of the minority. You know, he takes the time to talk to everybody. I actually happened to be with him about a month and a half ago. We did something that was so moving, a group of bipartisan legislators went over with the president and with House and Senate leadership to go to the 80th anniversary of B-Day at Normandy Beach in France. What I was talking about when saying, when finally making the very difficult decision that President Biden did not give us a good enough chance to win an election where the stakes are so high, it was about making sure that we, again, defeat what I see as the extremism coming from Donald Trump's MAGA Republican Party. And that's what it had to do with, and really nothing else.",
