    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/8/78130.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 20,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, because he's never said those words. That is someone saying, because he's not running, I think these things are happening. He's never said that. No one has ever said he's not running because of competency. I mean, he said in his statement, why he's not running? I said in my statement, why I didn't think he was the best person to run for Democrats. And it was always about win-ability. It was always about making sure that he continues to protect America from what I see as a real extremist threat from the far right and the elements that Donald Trump attracts. And so that's what I think it is about more than anything else.",
